@PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5039

### Criar conta
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Silva", "cpf": "529.982.247-25"
}

###

### Criar conta - nome curto (esperado 400)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Jo", "cpf": "111.444.777-35"
}

###

### Criar conta - CPF duplicado (esperado 409)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Silva", "cpf": "529.982.247-25"
}

###

### Buscar conta (troque o Guid abaixo pelo Id retornado ao criar a conta)
GET {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/f41fcc1c-f057-4769-a195-023438f6fbca
Accept: application/json

###

### Depositar
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/6b0208b0-b135-4785-8e98-1e5bbe4ef78c/depositar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 100
}

###

### Sacar
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/6b0208b0-b135-4785-8e98-1e5bbe4ef78c/sacar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 30
}

###

### Histórico de transações
GET {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/6b0208b0-b135-4785-8e98-1e5bbe4ef78c/transacoes
Accept: application/json

### Buscar conta com Id vazio (esperado 400)
GET {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### Buscar conta inexistente (esperado 404)
GET {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

###

# @name contaStatus
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Ana Souza",
  "cpf": "11144477735"
}

### Bloquear (200, status Bloqueada)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaStatus.response.body.$.id}}/bloquear

### Depositar em conta bloqueada (422)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaStatus.response.body.$.id}}/depositar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 100
}

### Bloquear de novo (422, transição inválida)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaStatus.response.body.$.id}}/bloquear

### Desbloquear (200, status Ativa)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaStatus.response.body.$.id}}/desbloquear

### Depositar (200)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaStatus.response.body.$.id}}/depositar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 100
}

### Encerrar com saldo (422)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaStatus.response.body.$.id}}/encerrar

### Sacar tudo (200, saldo 0)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaStatus.response.body.$.id}}/sacar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 100
}

### Encerrar (200, status Encerrada)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaStatus.response.body.$.id}}/encerrar

### Encerrar de novo (422)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaStatus.response.body.$.id}}/encerrar

### Criar conta (CPF novo: 201; se repetir, 409 e o resto da cadeia quebra)
# @name contaEventos
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos Pereira",
  "cpf": "453.178.287-91"
}

### Dia 11 - depositar 200 (200, saldo 200)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaEventos.response.body.$.id}}/depositar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 200
}

### Dia 11 - sacar 50 (200, saldo 150)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaEventos.response.body.$.id}}/sacar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 50
}

### Dia 11 - sacar acima do saldo (422)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaEventos.response.body.$.id}}/sacar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 1000
}

### Dia 11 - bloquear (200, status Bloqueada)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaEventos.response.body.$.id}}/bloquear

### Dia 11 - depositar em conta bloqueada (422)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaEventos.response.body.$.id}}/depositar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 10
}

### Dia 11 - desbloquear (200, status Ativa)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaEventos.response.body.$.id}}/desbloquear

### Dia 11 - encerrar com saldo (422)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaEventos.response.body.$.id}}/encerrar

### Dia 11 - sacar o saldo restante (200, saldo 0)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaEventos.response.body.$.id}}/sacar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 150
}

### Dia 11 - encerrar (200, status Encerrada)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaEventos.response.body.$.id}}/encerrar

### Dia 11 - depositar em conta encerrada (422)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaEventos.response.body.$.id}}/depositar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 10
}

### Dia 11 - histórico (200, deposito 200, saque 50, saque 150, nessa ordem)
GET {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/{{contaEventos.response.body.$.id}}/transacoes
Accept: application/json

### Dia 11 - buscar conta (após reiniciar a API: 200, Encerrada, saldo 0)
GET {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/091137ef-f418-4a74-8e76-b631e3095608
Accept: application/json

### Bloquear conta inexistente (404)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/bloquear